; Hand posed to wrap a grip. Its origin sits at the CENTRE of the grip
; it holds, so the arm rig can drop it straight onto a weapon's grip
; marker regardless of which weapon that is.
;
; The right hand's mirror in every dimension that matters; see it for why the
; fingers are capsules and what the wrist ball is for.
[gd_scene load_steps=11 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/textures/cloth_grain.tres" id="1_grain"]

; The glove: a hard back-plate over a suit that runs to the fingertips. Named
; Mat_skin still because every mesh in here points at it by that name, and a
; gauntlet is what this scene has always actually been -- the hand that grips
; the weapon.
